libfcache
------------------------------------------
libfcache is a library to provide generic file data cache functions.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache-devel-20260520-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfcache

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfcache/archive/refs/tags/20260520.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfcache-20260520-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfcache-20260520-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfcache-20260520-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfcache-20260520-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfcache1-20260520-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfcache-devel-20260520-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfcache)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfcache.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfcache/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfcache/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfcache/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfcache/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfcache/README

(libfcache1)
  /usr/bin/cygfcache-1.dll

(libfcache-devel)
  /usr/include/libfcache.h
  /usr/include/libfcache/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfcache/error.h
  /usr/include/libfcache/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfcache/features.h
  /usr/include/libfcache/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfcache.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfcache.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfcache.3.gz

